SUMMARY:Panigiri of the Holy Cross\, Stavros
LOCATION:Stavros\, Donousa\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The village is named for its church of the Holy Cross\, so 13-14 September is Stavros's own feast: vespers\, liturgy and a smaller repeat of the August panigiri with local food\, music and dancing\, at the end of the season when only islanders and a few stragglers are left.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/donousa/#stavros-panigiri-of-the-holy-cross-stavros
